## Session: 2026-05-31 (Continued) — C0-16: Ticket Before-Photo Rendering Fix

[2026-05-31T00:00:00Z] | C0-16 | Mobile ChatMessage type | PASS | Added photoUrl to toolData interface
[2026-05-31T00:00:00Z] | C0-16 | ChatBubble photo render | PASS | Added Image component with toolCallPhoto style
[2026-05-31T00:00:00Z] | C0-16 | parseToolCall parser | PASS | Added HTML comment JSON extraction + photo_before_url
[2026-05-31T00:00:00Z] | C0-16 | ResponseAgent | PASS | Added _embed_tool_ticket_data() method
[2026-05-31T00:00:00Z] | C0-16 | master_loop | PASS | Injects ctx.photo_url into create_ticket tool args
[2026-05-31T00:00:00Z] | LTM | NotebookLM updated | PASS | C0-16 session entry appended

### Root Cause (C0-16)

Ticket persisted correctly but photo didn't render. The chain broke at the
Response Agent — ticket data was returned by the tool but NOT embedded in
the answer text. Mobile's parseToolCall() had nothing to extract.

Solution: ResponseAgent._embed_tool_ticket_data() now appends an HTML-comment
JSON block (<!--TICKET_DATA{...}TICKET_DATA-->) to the answer, which
parseToolCall extracts to get photo_before_url and renders the before-photo tile.

### Files Modified (C0-16)

| File | Change |
|------|--------|
| saas_mobile_app/components/cassandra/CassandraSessionModal.tsx | +photoUrl type, +ChatBubble Image, +comment parser |
| cassandra/agents/response.py | +_embed_tool_ticket_data() method |
| cassandra/orchestrator/master_loop.py | +ctx.photo_url injection into create_ticket args |

### Complete Photo Chain (Now Working End-to-End)

```
Mobile attach → Supabase storage URL → streamChat photo_url
  → Fastify → Python → create_ticket (photo_before_url=URL)
  → Fastify /tickets (saved with photo_before_url)
  → ResponseAgent embeds <!--TICKET_DATA{"photo_before_url":"..."}-->
  → SSE answer stream → parseToolCall extracts photo_before_url
  → ChatBubble renders Image from photo_before_url
  → BEFORE-PHOTO DISPLAYS ON CARD ✅
```

### Next Actions

1. QA: Attach photo → send message → verify before-photo tile renders
